            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I have said all this to you to keep you from falling away. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.9.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 9.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.9+ACT.26.10+ACT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 26.9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.66.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 66.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " They will put you out of the synagogues; indeed, the hour is coming when whoever kills you will think he is offering service to God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they will do this because they have not known the Father, nor me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I have said these things to you, that when their hour comes you may remember that I told you of them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I did not say these things to you from the beginning, because I was with you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.7.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 7.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.14.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But now I am going to him who sent me; yet none of you asks me, ‘Where are you going?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But because I have said these things to you, sorrow has filled your hearts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.14.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 14.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.14.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.15.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nevertheless I tell you the truth: it is to your advantage that I go away, for if I do not go away, the Counselor will not come to you; but if I go, I will send him to you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when he comes, he will convince",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "convict",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the world concerning sin and righteousness and judgment: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.15.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 15.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " concerning sin, because they do not believe in me; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
