            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " concerning righteousness, because I go to the Father, and you will see me no more; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 12.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " concerning judgment, because the ruler of this world is judged.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I have yet many things to say to you, but you cannot bear them now. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the Spirit of truth comes, he will guide you into all the truth; for he will not speak on his own authority, but whatever he hears he will speak, and he will declare to you the things that are to come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.7.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 7.39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He will glorify me, for he will take what is mine and declare it to you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All that the Father has is mine; therefore I said that he will take what is mine and declare it to you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
