          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His disciples said, “Ah, now you are speaking plainly, not in any figure! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now we know that you know all things, and need none to question you; by this we believe that you came from God.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered them, “Do you now believe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
