            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The hour is coming, indeed it has come, when you will be scattered, every man to his home, and will leave me alone; yet I am not alone, for the Father is with me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.32",
